# qwen3.6:27b as an LLM judge, sized for a 16 GB card (RTX 5070 Ti) + 32 GB RAM.
#
# Weights are ~17 GB, so this does NOT fit in 16 GB VRAM. Expect roughly
# 2-5 GB to spill to system RAM -- which is fine on 32 GB and is the reason
# this model is usable on the Ti but was not on an 8 GB laptop (there, 17 GB of
# weights against 15.7 GB of RAM meant the model paged to DISK and ran at
# ~1 token/s).
#
# Check after the first load:
#   ollama ps   -> expect something like 75%/25% GPU/CPU, NOT a 0 GB working set
#
# num_ctx 16384 costs ~2.7 GB of KV cache here. Lowering it to 8192 buys back
# ~1.3 GB of VRAM if the split looks worse than expected; the judge prompts fit
# in 8K comfortably.
#
#   ollama create qwen36-judge -f Modelfile.qwen36-judge

FROM qwen3.6:27b

PARAMETER num_ctx 16384
PARAMETER temperature 0
